T*
(1 - [ 0.0864 / 0.39 ] = 1 - 0.2215 = 0.7785.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Tolerable Touch and Step Voltage Thresholds \(for 50 kg body weight\):) Tj
T*
(- Body resistance is standardized at R_b = 1,000 Ohms.) Tj
T*
(- Foot-to-ground resistance \(series combination of both feet for touch\): R_f_touch = 1.5) Tj
T*
(* C_s * rho_s) Tj
T*
(R_f_touch = 1.5 * 0.7785 * 2,500 = 2,919.4 Ohms.) Tj
T*
(- Tolerable Touch Voltage:) Tj
T*
(E_touch_50 = [ 1,000 + 1.5 * C_s * rho_s ] * \(0.116 / sqrt\(t_s\)\)) Tj
T*
(E_touch_50 = [ 1,000 + 2,919.4 ] * \(0.116 / sqrt\(0.50\)\) = 3,919.4 * \(0.116 / 0.7071\) =) Tj
T*
(3,919.4 * 0.16405 = 643.0 V.) Tj
T*
(- Foot-to-ground resistance \(series combination of feet for step\): R_f_step = 6.0 * C_s) Tj
T*
(* rho_s) Tj
T*
(R_f_step = 6.0 * 0.7785 * 2,500 = 11,677.5 Ohms.) Tj
T*
(- Tolerable Step Voltage:) Tj
T*
(E_step_50 = [ 1,000 + 6.0 * C_s * rho_s ] * \(0.116 / sqrt\(t_s\)\)) Tj
T*
(E_step_50 = [ 1,000 + 11,677.5 ] * 0.16405 = 12,677.5 * 0.16405 = 2,079.7 V.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Minimum Ground Conductor Sizing \(Onderdonk Formula\):) Tj
T*
(- Conductor cross-sectional area A_kcmil = I_f * K_f * sqrt\(t_s\)) Tj
T*
(- For copper with ambient temperature 40 deg C and maximum allowable joint temperature) Tj
T*
(450 deg C:) Tj
T*
(A_mm2 = I_f / [ sqrt\( \( \(T_cap\) / \(t_s * alpha_0 * rho_r\) \) * ln\( \(K_0 + T_m\) / \(K_0 +) Tj
T*
(T_a\) \) \) ]) Tj
T*
(- Standard simplified formula: A_mm2 = \(I_f_amps * sqrt\(t_s\)\) / 226) Tj
T*
(A_mm2 = \(12,000 * sqrt\(0.50\)\) / 226 = \(12,000 * 0.7071\) / 226 = 8,485.28 / 226 = 37.55) Tj
T*
(sq mm.) Tj
T*
(- Accounting for corrosion allowance over a 30-year design life \(standard factor 2.0x\):) Tj
T*
(A_design = 2.0 * 37.55 = 75.1 sq mm. Select standard 95 sq mm stranded bare copper) Tj
T*
(conductor.) Tj
T*
