T*
(Statement: An industrial 415 V motor control center \(MCC\) has an available bolted) Tj
T*
(3-phase fault current of I_bf = 28.0 kA. The feeder circuit breaker trips in t = 0.06) Tj
T*
(seconds. The bus enclosure has a working distance of D = 455 mm \(18 inches\):) Tj
T*
