T*
(- Claim 1 \(Independent System Claim\): A grid-interactive electric vehicle charging) Tj
T*
(system comprising a solar PV array, a bi-directional BESS converter, and a) Tj
T*
(microcontroller programmed with real-time multi-source power balancing.) Tj
T*
(- Claim 2 \(Method Claim\): A method for dynamically curtailing EV pilot duty cycles in) Tj
T*
(response to real-time grid tariff pricing, cloud transient irradiance drops, and BESS) Tj
T*
(temperature gradients to maintain zero grid export penalties while preventing customer) Tj
T*
(demand charge spikes.) Tj
